					"content": "去吧，月靈們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830402,
					"content": "猜猜看這是什麼圖案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830403,
						760830407,
						760830412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830403,
					"content": "月亮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760830404,
					"content": "！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "月靈"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830405,
					"content": "哼哼，這次還是滿明顯的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830406,
					"content": "對我們來說，這個謎底有些過於簡單了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830407,
					"content": "陸鰻鰻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760830408,
					"content": "這次的這位是腰部出了問題？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830409,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們的見聞真的非常豐富呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830410,
					"content": "正確答案是月亮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830411,
					"content": "回來吧，做得很好哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830412,
					"content": "圓弧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760830413,
					"content": "誰都看得出來是圓弧吧！那麼簡單的結論怎麼可能是正確答案啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760830414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760830414,
					"content": "的確不能說有錯，可惜這並不是月靈們的本意。",
